## Sensor Status

| Sensor | Protocol | Address | Status |
|--------|---------|---------|--------|
| BH1750 (light) | I2C | 0x23 | ✓ Detected |
| SCD40 (CO2) | I2C | 0x62 | ✓ Detected |
| BMP280 (temp/pressure) | I2C / SPI | 0x76 | ✗ Faulty — discarded |

