## Hardware Notes

- ESP32-CAM (AI-Thinker): safe I2C pins are GPIO14 (SDA) and GPIO15 (SCL)
- Bare ESP32: standard I2C pins are GPIO21 (SDA) and GPIO22 (SCL)
- Flash LED on ESP32-CAM: GPIO4, controlled via PWM (ledcWrite)
- Always power ESP32 from clean 5V supply — weak supply causes brownout reboots
- ST7789 display: 3.3V logic only — needs level shifter with Arduino Uno